<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 0.5in; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">(dd) <U>Accountants</U>.
The Company&rsquo;s independent registered public accounting firm is TAAD, LLP. To the knowledge and belief of the Company, such accounting
